Package: SpatialData.data
Title: SpatialData datasets
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0)
Version: 0.99.9
Description: 
    Utilities for accessing and importing spatialdata examples 
    from scverse. The examples are downloaded from NSF OSN  using 
    'BiocFileCache' and readouts are converted into SpatialData objects (.zarr)
    using 'spatialdata-io' via basilisk.
